Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.40,DAD,,0,0,0,,HANG ON. I MADE TWELVE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.40,0:00:03.34,DAD,,0,0,0,,PANCAKES. WHY ARE THERE ELEVEN?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.49,0:00:04.09,LILY,,0,0,0,,GHOST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.41,0:00:06.52,MAX,,0,0,0,,LILY, STOP SAYING GHOST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.82,0:00:10.29,LILY,,0,0,0,,GHOST, GHOST, GHOST, GHOST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.58,DAD,,0,0,0,,FINE. GHOST, IF YOU'RE LISTENING,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.94,DAD,,0,0,0,,THE SYRUP'S IN THE CUPBOARD.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.56,0:00:17.15,SKYE,,0,0,0,,BEST. PANCAKE. EVER.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.26,SKYE,,0,0,0,,WOW. YOU LOOK TERRIBLE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.48,0:00:21.15,MAX,,0,0,0,,MY HOUSE IS HAUNTED.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.62,MAX,,0,0,0,,IT KNOWS MY NAME.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.82,0:00:25.22,SKYE,,0,0,0,,A GHOST? I THOUGHT NOTHING SCARES YOU.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.33,0:00:28.14,MAX,,0,0,0,,I'M NOT SCARED. I'M JUST VERY ALERT.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.37,0:00:29.87,SKYE,,0,0,0,,SURE. THAT'S WHY YOU
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.87,0:00:30.98,SKYE,,0,0,0,,HID UNDER YOUR BLANKET.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:33.00,MAX,,0,0,0,,HOW DO YOU KNOW THAT?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.18,0:00:35.99,SKYE,,0,0,0,,LUCKY GUESS. EVERYBODY DOES THAT. BYE!
